{"ocrText": "love the dog so much. He doesn't cause any trouble. Piggy took\nus to the vet and they gave poor St. Francis\na shot. He's in\na\ncage. Whether you\nlike\nit or not,\nI've got him. Mom gave me\nmoney to put him\nin\na kennel\nif\nit will really upset you, but\nplease say that he can stay with me. Please, please.\"\nLucy\ntried\nto\ntake\nin\nNicole's\nrush\nof words.\nShe\nhad\nbrought the dog. Why hadn't Jane kept the dog? Why did any-\none think she would care if Nicole had the dog? Where was the\ndog?\n\"You're going to think this\nis\nreally awful, but Mom's\nin\nlove. He's a tennis player, and he's twenty-five years old, and\nthey're going to the Inn at Ojai and everything, and Mom just\ndidn't have anyplace\nto put poor\nSt.\nFrancis\nbut\na kennel\nwhere he got gross fleas\n.\n.\n.\"\n\"Twenty-five?\" Lucy said.\n\"Mom said not to tell you\u2014oh, he's sort of neat. He's taught\nme all this stuff about playing tennis. He's very handsome. He\nmight be twenty-four and he's going to be twenty-five. This\nweekend\nis his birthday, and he was going to introduce me to\nChris Evert, but\nI had my ticket and everything, and they were\ngoing to Ojai the next day and everything.\"\nNicole spotted\nSt.\nFrancis' cage.\nIt was\ngigantic. She and\nNicole had to tug together to pull\nit off the conveyor belt. \"I\ncan do\nit, oh, let me do it!\" Nicole said. She began to unfasten\nthe cage. When the top was\nlifted,\nSt. Francis shook himself\nand\nfell\nagainst one\nside of the\ncage.\nNicole put\nher arms\naround his neck. \"Oh,\nI love you, St. Francis. You're all right.\nYou're in Vermont now.\" The dog's eyes were bloodshot. He\ntried to stand, and thumped down again. \"Is he ever going to\nforgive us?\" Nicole said.\nThat afternoon, as the tranquilizer wore off, St. Francis dug\nup a rhododendron. For an encore, he treed the neighbor's cat\nand\nkilled\na frog and dropped\nit on the doorstep. He peed\nagainst the side of the house, under the kitchen window, and\nate no dinner. He was the quintessential villainous dog. As Ni-\ncole said, he was \"a good boy.\"\n33", "textLayer": [{"text": "love", "x": 6.11, "y": 5.23, "w": 4.79, "h": 1.51, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "the", "x": 11.85, "y": 5.2, "w": 3.7, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 7.8}, {"text": "dog", "x": 16.49, "y": 4.95, "w": 4.41, "h": 1.86, "fontSize": 9.3}, {"text": "so", "x": 21.8, "y": 5.21, "w": 2.37, "h": 1.5, "fontSize": 7.5}, {"text": "much.", "x": 25.12, "y": 4.9, "w": 7.44, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 9.4}, {"text": "He", "x": 33.74, "y": 4.62, "w": 3.51, "h": 2.22, "fontSize": 11.1}, {"text": "doesn't", "x": 38.2, "y": 5.08, "w": 8.62, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 7.8}, {"text": "cause", "x": 47.82, "y": 4.99, "w": 6.49, "h": 1.64, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "any", "x": 55.31, "y": 4.89, "w": 4.22, "h": 1.78, "fontSize": 8.9}, {"text": "trouble.", "x": 60.57, "y": 5.1, "w": 9.48, "h": 1.5, "fontSize": 7.5}, {"text": "Piggy", "x": 71.23, "y": 4.93, "w": 6.82, "h": 1.73, "fontSize": 8.6}, {"text": "took", "x": 79.1, "y": 4.97, "w": 5.17, "h": 1.63, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "us", "x": 6.07, "y": 7.39, "w": 2.46, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 7.8}, {"text": "to", "x": 9.76, "y": 7.45, "w": 2.32, "h": 1.47, "fontSize": 7.3}, {"text": "the", "x": 13.22, "y": 7.34, "w": 3.74, "h": 1.58, "fontSize": 7.9}, {"text": "vet", "x": 18.2, "y": 7.42, "w": 3.51, "h": 1.48, "fontSize": 7.4}, {"text": "and", "x": 22.99, "y": 7.16, "w": 4.31, "h": 1.82, "fontSize": 9.1}, {"text": "they", "x": 28.53, "y": 7.24, "w": 5.31, "h": 1.68, "fontSize": 8.4}, {"text": "gave", "x": 35.17, "y": 7.2, "w": 5.36, "h": 1.69, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "poor", "x": 41.52, "y": 7.01, "w": 6.02, "h": 1.9, "fontSize": 9.5}, {"text": "St.", "x": 48.81, "y": 7.47, "w": 3.08, "h": 1.3, "fontSize": 6.5}, {"text": "Francis", "x": 53.32, "y": 7.21, "w": 8.86, "h": 1.6, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "a", "x": 63.55, "y": 7.54, "w": 0.95, "h": 1.2, "fontSize": 6.0}, {"text": "shot.", "x": 65.88, "y": 7.32, "w": 5.59, "